WEBVTT

1
00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:30.715
In Chapter 17, Lord Krishna has so
far described sacrifice,

2
00:01:30.715 --> 00:01:32.342
austerity, and charity

3
00:01:32.342 --> 00:01:34.803
like human actions,

4
00:01:34.803 --> 00:01:36.846
and has also explained

5
00:01:36.846 --> 00:01:40.016
how they are influenced by the
three gunas – sattvic, rajasic,

6
00:01:40.016 --> 00:01:43.311
and tamasic.

7
00:01:43.311 --> 00:01:47.065
Now in verses 17.23 to 17.27, Lord Krishna

8
00:01:47.065 --> 00:01:50.026
takes the discussion to a higher level.

9
00:01:50.026 --> 00:01:53.279
He explains that even if an action is sattvic,

10
00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:58.368
it still remains at the material level.

11
00:01:58.368 --> 00:01:59.911
So the question arises –

12
00:01:59.911 --> 00:02:03.123
how do we rise above these gunas,
and how do we

13
00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:05.917
completely purify these actions?

14
00:02:05.917 --> 00:02:08.294
In answer, Lord Krishna introduces three

15
00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:11.381
sacred sounds.

16
00:02:11.381 --> 00:02:13.174
Om,

17
00:02:13.174 --> 00:02:16.177
Tat, and Sat.

18
00:02:16.177 --> 00:02:17.887
These are not merely syllables,

19
00:02:17.887 --> 00:02:21.432
but true signposts of the Vedic tradition,

20
00:02:21.432 --> 00:02:25.103
which point us toward the Supreme Truth.

21
00:02:25.103 --> 00:02:26.437
When they are uttered with faith

22
00:02:26.437 --> 00:02:29.190
and sincerity,

23
00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:31.234
they grant spiritual power

24
00:02:31.234 --> 00:02:34.946
even to our ordinary actions.

25
00:02:34.946 --> 00:02:37.657
The gunas bind us –

26
00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:41.703
Om Tat Sat sets us free.

27
00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:49.169
In verse 17.23, Lord Krishna explains

28
00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:54.549
that Om Tat Sat is not a modern invention,

29
00:02:54.549 --> 00:02:56.509
but has been used since the very

30
00:02:56.509 --> 00:02:59.470
beginning of creation.

31
00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:01.139
The brahmanas, who have been

32
00:03:01.139 --> 00:03:04.267
the traditional guardians of Vedic knowledge,

33
00:03:04.267 --> 00:03:06.186
used to utter these three sacred sounds

34
00:03:06.186 --> 00:03:11.065
during sacrifices and in the
chanting of Vedic mantras.

35
00:03:11.065 --> 00:03:13.234
These sounds are not merely syllables,

36
00:03:13.234 --> 00:03:15.737
but symbols of the Supreme Truth,

37
00:03:15.737 --> 00:03:19.741
and hold the power to sanctify any action.

38
00:03:19.741 --> 00:03:21.826
Om – represents

39
00:03:21.826 --> 00:03:24.704
the Supreme Truth

40
00:03:24.704 --> 00:03:28.666
and directly invokes the Lord.

41
00:03:28.666 --> 00:03:33.296
Tat – that is, ‘that,’ reminds us that every

42
00:03:33.296 --> 00:03:35.798
offering is for that Supreme,

43
00:03:35.798 --> 00:03:38.551
not for our own self-interest.

44
00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:41.804
Sat – eternal and sacred,

45
00:03:41.804 --> 00:03:47.101
which is the essence of truth and
the spiritual goal.

46
00:03:47.101 --> 00:03:51.606
Even if material desires get mixed
into austerity or charity,

47
00:03:51.606 --> 00:03:53.149
still the remembrance of Om

48
00:03:53.149 --> 00:03:54.943
Tat Sat slowly

49
00:03:54.943 --> 00:03:57.654
lifts the consciousness higher.

50
00:03:57.654 --> 00:04:00.657
For those whose faith is not
yet scripturally aligned,

51
00:04:00.657 --> 00:04:03.368
or who are caught in the bondage of the gunas,

52
00:04:03.368 --> 00:04:08.706
these sounds become a spiritual bridge.

53
00:04:08.706 --> 00:04:11.334
In verse 17.24, Lord Krishna explains

54
00:04:11.334 --> 00:04:12.585
that the seekers

55
00:04:12.585 --> 00:04:15.380
who truly desire spiritual progress

56
00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:17.298
begin each of their sacrifices,

57
00:04:17.298 --> 00:04:21.511
charity, and austerity with Om.

58
00:04:21.511 --> 00:04:23.680
Because they know that every action

59
00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:26.808
becomes complete and pure only when

60
00:04:26.808 --> 00:04:29.978
it is dedicated to the Paramatma.

61
00:04:29.978 --> 00:04:31.271
In verse 17.25,

62
00:04:31.271 --> 00:04:34.816
He explains the secret of the use of Tat.

63
00:04:34.816 --> 00:04:36.109
When seekers who long

64
00:04:36.109 --> 00:04:40.029
for moksha perform charity,
sacrifice, or austerity,

65
00:04:40.029 --> 00:04:41.656
then ‘This is not for me –

66
00:04:41.656 --> 00:04:43.616
this is for the Supreme Divine.’

67
00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:46.619
They offer it with that feeling.

68
00:04:46.619 --> 00:04:49.664
This humility reduces ego

69
00:04:49.664 --> 00:04:52.709
and brings detachment within.

70
00:04:52.709 --> 00:04:55.420
In verses 17.26 and 17.27,

71
00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:58.589
Lord Krishna explains the importance of Sat.

72
00:04:58.589 --> 00:05:01.634
Sat is not only a symbol of the Supreme Lord,

73
00:05:01.634 --> 00:05:04.721
but also of His devotees, of the actions done

74
00:05:04.721 --> 00:05:09.809
for Him, and of all sacred duties.

75
00:05:09.809 --> 00:05:12.395
Any commendable action –

76
00:05:12.395 --> 00:05:15.189
whether it is service in a temple, making prasad,

77
00:05:15.189 --> 00:05:17.692
or cleaning a sacred place –

78
00:05:17.692 --> 00:05:20.737
if it is done for the pleasure of the Lord, then

79
00:05:20.737 --> 00:05:22.447
it is called a sat-karma

80
00:05:22.447 --> 00:05:25.408
and gives eternal fruit.

81
00:05:25.408 --> 00:05:30.330
Lord Krishna uses the words
‘sadbhave sadhubhave’ –

82
00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:31.664
that is, both the Supreme Truth

83
00:05:31.664 --> 00:05:33.875
and the saint devoted to it

84
00:05:33.875 --> 00:05:35.710
are sat.

85
00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:38.921
The actions that are done for the Supreme essence,

86
00:05:38.921 --> 00:05:42.800
or the seekers engaged in the search for it,

87
00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:45.887
are equally considered sacred.

88
00:05:45.887 --> 00:05:48.681
Finally, Lord Krishna gives the assurance that

89
00:05:48.681 --> 00:05:50.308
even if someone's faith

90
00:05:50.308 --> 00:05:51.392
is not scripturally

91
00:05:51.392 --> 00:05:56.022
aligned, still, if they continuously remember Om

92
00:05:56.022 --> 00:05:58.107
Tat Sat and keep

93
00:05:58.107 --> 00:06:00.026
acting with that feeling,

94
00:06:00.026 --> 00:06:03.613
then their heart becomes pure,
and their consciousness

95
00:06:03.613 --> 00:06:08.534
slowly rises from materiality toward divinity.

96
00:06:08.534 --> 00:06:10.286
In short, Lord Krishna

97
00:06:10.286 --> 00:06:14.499
acquaints us with a universal principle –

98
00:06:14.499 --> 00:06:16.417
it makes no difference

99
00:06:16.417 --> 00:06:17.835
where we currently stand

100
00:06:17.835 --> 00:06:20.380
on our spiritual journey –

101
00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.673
whether surrounded by material attractions

102
00:06:22.673 --> 00:06:25.635
or with purity showing us the way –

103
00:06:25.635 --> 00:06:26.886
these sacred sounds

104
00:06:26.886 --> 00:06:29.639
help us to rise higher.

105
00:06:29.639 --> 00:06:35.561
They will transform duty into devotion,
and actions into surrender.

106
00:06:40.108 --> 00:06:44.028
You may perform the greatest of actions –

107
00:06:44.028 --> 00:06:46.906
serving others, fasting,

108
00:06:46.906 --> 00:06:50.034
charity – but

109
00:06:50.034 --> 00:06:54.122
if your heart is still attached,

110
00:06:54.122 --> 00:06:58.209
then the gunas of nature will keep on binding you.

111
00:06:58.209 --> 00:07:01.045
Sattva brings peace,

112
00:07:01.045 --> 00:07:04.632
rajas inflames ambition,

113
00:07:04.632 --> 00:07:09.095
and tamas creates delusion.

114
00:07:09.095 --> 00:07:12.390
So the question here is –

115
00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:16.310
how do we rise above these?

116
00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:18.813
The answer is clear –

117
00:07:18.813 --> 00:07:22.942
through the conscious harmony of awareness.

118
00:07:22.942 --> 00:07:25.862
And the second question comes –

119
00:07:25.862 --> 00:07:29.824
how is consciousness to be mastered?

120
00:07:29.824 --> 00:07:32.034
The answer –

121
00:07:32.034 --> 00:07:33.744
through sound.

122
00:07:33.744 --> 00:07:37.540
Om Tat Sat.

123
00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:40.751
These sacred syllables are not merely words,

124
00:07:40.751 --> 00:07:45.047
but spiritual instruments.

125
00:07:45.047 --> 00:07:46.966
Om –

126
00:07:46.966 --> 00:07:50.386
calls your mind toward Me.

127
00:07:50.386 --> 00:07:51.971
Tat –

128
00:07:51.971 --> 00:07:54.765
reminds you that this action

129
00:07:54.765 --> 00:07:58.186
is not yours, but the Supreme's.

130
00:07:58.186 --> 00:08:03.024
Sat – connects you to the eternal truth.

131
00:08:03.024 --> 00:08:07.403
When you utter them with faith –

132
00:08:07.403 --> 00:08:12.116
even quietly within –

133
00:08:12.116 --> 00:08:16.537
then your actions begin to change.

134
00:08:16.537 --> 00:08:20.958
You begin to give, to serve, to speak –

135
00:08:20.958 --> 00:08:24.420
not to impress others,

136
00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:28.716
but with the feeling of offering.

137
00:08:28.716 --> 00:08:32.386
You stop clinging to results,

138
00:08:32.386 --> 00:08:36.015
and the heart becomes free of burden.

139
00:08:36.015 --> 00:08:40.978
I do not see only what you are doing –

140
00:08:40.978 --> 00:08:44.857
but also how you are changing within

141
00:08:44.857 --> 00:08:48.694
while doing it.

142
00:08:48.694 --> 00:08:53.324
Do not let your actions remain mere reactions. 

143
00:08:53.324 --> 00:08:55.785
Lift them up,

144
00:08:55.785 --> 00:08:58.829
anchor them in the sacred sound.

145
00:08:58.829 --> 00:09:00.790
This is the path by which

146
00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:04.544
you can walk free even while living

147
00:09:04.544 --> 00:09:07.338
in the world.

148
00:09:12.134 --> 00:09:15.012
A seeker offers every action

149
00:09:15.012 --> 00:09:17.431
to Me –

150
00:09:17.431 --> 00:09:19.809
and you too can do the same,

151
00:09:19.809 --> 00:09:22.728
while living in your own home.

152
00:09:22.728 --> 00:09:28.401
Cooking food, caring for children,
managing relationships –

153
00:09:28.401 --> 00:09:31.612
these are not only family duties,

154
00:09:31.612 --> 00:09:34.240
but sacred opportunities.

155
00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:38.744
When these are done with expectations,

156
00:09:38.744 --> 00:09:43.833
then often fatigue or disappointment results.

157
00:09:43.833 --> 00:09:46.586
But when every act is offered

158
00:09:46.586 --> 00:09:50.798
to Me with a calm feeling,

159
00:09:50.798 --> 00:09:55.469
without considering the result your right,

160
00:09:55.469 --> 00:09:58.639
then these very acts become sacred.

161
00:09:58.639 --> 00:10:03.185
The actions remain the same,
but your consciousness

162
00:10:03.185 --> 00:10:05.646
begins to rise.

163
00:10:05.646 --> 00:10:09.150
You stop asking –

164
00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:12.987
‘Why was my effort not appreciated?’

165
00:10:12.987 --> 00:10:16.449
And you begin to feel –

166
00:10:16.449 --> 00:10:22.246
‘How can I serve more with love?’

167
00:10:22.246 --> 00:10:25.374
This transformation frees you from the pull

168
00:10:25.374 --> 00:10:29.211
of reward or dissatisfaction.

169
00:10:29.211 --> 00:10:32.882
Even the small, ordinary tasks of the family,

170
00:10:32.882 --> 00:10:36.385
if done with the feeling of devotion,

171
00:10:36.385 --> 00:10:41.182
become spiritual practice.

172
00:10:41.182 --> 00:10:44.268
Serve while remembering Om

173
00:10:44.268 --> 00:10:49.357
Tat Sat in your heart.

174
00:10:49.357 --> 00:10:51.067
Make your family

175
00:10:51.067 --> 00:10:53.486
a sacred place –

176
00:10:53.486 --> 00:10:55.946
not through decoration,

177
00:10:55.946 --> 00:11:00.117
but through your living feeling.

178
00:11:00.117 --> 00:11:05.289
This is the path by which your journey of rising

179
00:11:05.289 --> 00:11:09.043
begins from within yourself.

180
00:11:13.673 --> 00:11:17.802
You build your professional life over years,

181
00:11:17.802 --> 00:11:23.015
solving problems, leading teams.

182
00:11:23.015 --> 00:11:24.433
But if

183
00:11:24.433 --> 00:11:27.895
your work is filled with worry, ego,

184
00:11:27.895 --> 00:11:31.399
or the craving for respect,

185
00:11:31.399 --> 00:11:34.985
then this very thing binds you.

186
00:11:34.985 --> 00:11:37.863
And when the same is done with a changed

187
00:11:37.863 --> 00:11:39.865
consciousness,

188
00:11:39.865 --> 00:11:42.785
then it sets you free.

189
00:11:42.785 --> 00:11:45.955
Make your work not a bondage,

190
00:11:45.955 --> 00:11:48.374
but a means of liberation.

191
00:11:48.374 --> 00:11:50.543
Do you know how?

192
00:11:50.543 --> 00:11:53.087
Before every task – whether

193
00:11:53.087 --> 00:11:54.422
it is a conversation,

194
00:11:54.422 --> 00:11:57.341
a plan, or a responsibility –

195
00:11:57.341 --> 00:12:01.095
pause for a moment and remember:

196
00:12:01.095 --> 00:12:03.556
‘This is not mine.

197
00:12:03.556 --> 00:12:07.351
This is offered as service.’

198
00:12:07.351 --> 00:12:09.228
This is not only a word,

199
00:12:09.228 --> 00:12:11.188
it is an attitude –

200
00:12:11.188 --> 00:12:16.235
of doing every action with the
feeling of surrender.

201
00:12:16.235 --> 00:12:19.029
This remembrance connects your effort

202
00:12:19.029 --> 00:12:22.324
to that same divine flow

203
00:12:22.324 --> 00:12:27.997
which has been running the world
since the beginning of creation.

204
00:12:27.997 --> 00:12:33.210
Om – steadies your consciousness.

205
00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:37.131
Tat – dissolves the ego.

206
00:12:37.131 --> 00:12:39.717
Sat – connects you

207
00:12:39.717 --> 00:12:42.762
to truth and the eternal goal.

208
00:12:42.762 --> 00:12:45.473
When you stop working

209
00:12:45.473 --> 00:12:47.391
for recognition

210
00:12:47.391 --> 00:12:51.437
and begin doing it with the feeling of offering,

211
00:12:51.437 --> 00:12:56.066
then pressure decreases, clarity increases,

212
00:12:56.066 --> 00:12:59.987
and joy returns.

213
00:12:59.987 --> 00:13:03.574
I do not tell you to do

214
00:13:03.574 --> 00:13:08.037
less work – rather I tell you that whatever work

215
00:13:08.037 --> 00:13:15.169
you do, do it with greater depth,
with deeper spiritual connection.

216
00:13:15.169 --> 00:13:18.631
Make every action a step

217
00:13:18.631 --> 00:13:23.552
that lifts you higher – not a burden

218
00:13:23.552 --> 00:13:26.222
that pulls you down.

219
00:13:26.222 --> 00:13:29.558
These sacred sounds, these sacred feelings,

220
00:13:29.558 --> 00:13:31.894
will move you swiftly forward

221
00:13:31.894 --> 00:13:34.897
on the path of liberation.

222
00:13:34.897 --> 00:13:36.190
Reflect on this.
